<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
<meta name="ProgId" content="Word.Document">
<meta name="Generator" content="Microsoft Word">
<title>02_기능차트</title>
<!--[if gte mso 9]>
<xml>
<w:WordDocument>
<w:View>Print</w:View>
<w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
</w:WordDocument>
</xml>
<![endif]-->
<style>
body { font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; }
</style>
</head>
<body><p><h1 style="border-bottom:2px solid #333;padding-bottom:5px;color:#1976D2;">02. 기능차트 — 6단계 워크플로우 + 87개 라우트</h1></p><p><blockquote style="border-left:4px solid #1976D2;padding-left:10px;color:#555;margin:10px 0;"><strong>작성일</strong>: 2026-06-01 / PM 브라운킴</blockquote></p><p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #ccc;"></p><p><h2 style="border-bottom:1px solid #999;padding-bottom:3px;color:#1976D2;">1. 6단계 워크플로우 (헌법 #8 절대 순서)</h2></p><p><pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>[1.설정] → [2.마스터] → [3.매입] → [4.판매] → [5.현황/재고] → [6.재무]</pre></p><p>순서 벗어나면 PM 타임키퍼가 즉시 경고.</p><p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #ccc;"></p><p><h2 style="border-bottom:1px solid #999;padding-bottom:3px;color:#1976D2;">2. 카테고리별 기능 트리 (라우트 89개)</h2></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.1 설정 (16건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>설정
├─ 회사정보 (/company)
├─ 사용자정보 (/settings/user-info)
├─ 사원관리 (/employees)
├─ 권한설정 (/users/permissions)
├─ 직책관리 (/settings/positions)
├─ 결재라인 (/settings/approval-lines)
├─ 결재설정 (/settings/approval)
├─ 기기관리 (/settings/devices)
├─ 이메일설정 (/settings/email)
├─ 인쇄설정 (/print-settings)
├─ 양식정보설정 (/settings/form-templates)  ← 양식용지/순백지 분기
├─ 구독결제 (/settings/subscription-billing)
├─ 데이터백업 (/data/backup)
├─ 로그 (/data/logs)
├─ MDB마이그 (/settings/mdb-migration)
└─ 약관동의 (/terms)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.2 마스터 (8건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>마스터
├─ 업체관리 (/partners)
│  ├─ 업체원장 (/partners/ledger)
│  └─ 업체특별단가 (/partners/special-prices)
├─ 상품관리 (/items)
│  ├─ 상품원장 (/items/ledger)
│  └─ 상품특별단가 (/items/special-prices)
└─ BOM (/bom)
   └─ BOM신규 (/bom/new)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.3 매입 흐름 (9건, 헌법 #20)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>매입
├─ 발주서 (/purchase-orders) ─→ 발주현황 (/purchase-order-status)
├─ 매입명세서 (/purchases)    ─→ 매입현황 (/purchase-status)
│  ├─ 매입요약 (/purchases/summary)
│  ├─ 매입통계 (/purchase/statistics)
│  └─ 매입순위 (/purchase/ranking)
└─ 반품처리 (/returns)        ─→ 반품현황 (/return-status)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.4 판매 흐름 (12건, 헌법 #20)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>판매
├─ 견적서 (/quotations)         ─→ 견적현황 (/quotation-status)
├─ 수주서 (/sales-orders)       ─→ 수주현황 (/sales-order-status)
│  └─ 수주신규 (/sales-orders/new)
├─ 거래명세서 (/deliveries)
├─ 판매현황 (/sales)
│  ├─ 판매요약 (/sales/summary)
│  ├─ 판매통계 (/sales/statistics)
│  ├─ 판매순위 (/sales/ranking)
│  └─ 판매수익성 (/sales/profitability)
└─ 엑셀임포트 (/sales/import)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.5 재고 (7건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>재고
├─ 재고현황 (/stock)
├─ 재고원장 (/stock/ledger)
├─ 재고조정 (/stock/adjust)
├─ 재고이동 (/stock/transfer) ─→ 이동현황 (/stock/transfer-status)
└─ 창고관리 (/stock/warehouse-manage)
   └─ 창고분할 (/stock/warehouse-split)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.6 재무 (14건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>재무
├─ 회계 (/accounting)
│  ├─ 계정과목 (/accounting/accounts)
│  ├─ 경비처리 (/accounting/expenses)
│  ├─ 월마감 (/accounting/monthly-closing)
│  ├─ 손익 (/accounting/profit)
│  ├─ 매입매출장 (/accounting/purchase-sales)
│  ├─ 부가세 (/accounting/vat)
│  └─ 세무신고 (/accounting/export)
├─ 자금
│  ├─ 은행거래 (/accounting/bank-transactions)
│  ├─ 카드결제 (/accounting/card-payments)
│  ├─ 어음수표 (/accounting/bills)
│  └─ 출납장 (/accounting/cashbook)
└─ 수금·지급
   ├─ 수금 (/collections)
   └─ 지급 (/payments)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.7 인사 (HR, 15건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>인사
├─ HR사원 (/hr/employees)
├─ 부서 (/hr/departments)
├─ 직위 (/hr/positions)
├─ 근태 (/hr/attendance) ─→ 근태달력 (/hr/attendance-calendar)
├─ 연차 (/hr/leave)
│  ├─ 연차신청 (/hr/leave-request)
│  ├─ 연차현황 (/hr/leave-status)
│  └─ 연차달력 (/hr/leave-calendar)
├─ 초과근무 (/hr/overtime)
├─ 경비신청 (/hr/expense-request) ─→ 경비현황 (/hr/expense-status)
└─ 근로계약 (/hr/labor-contracts)
   ├─ 계약작성 (/hr/labor-contracts/create)
   ├─ 계약서명 (/hr/labor-contracts/{Id}/sign)
   └─ 서명이력 (/hr/esign-history)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.8 결재 (3건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>결재
├─ 결재대기 (/approval/pending)
├─ 결재완료 (/approval/completed)
└─ 결재발신 (/approval/sent)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.9 공통 (5건)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>공통
├─ 홈 (/)
├─ 대시보드 (/dashboard)
├─ 환영 (/welcome)
├─ 로그인 (/login)
└─ More (/more)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.10 모바일 (10건, Phase 5)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>모바일
├─ MobileItems (/mobile/items)
├─ MobilePartners (/mobile/partners)
├─ MobilePurchaseOrder (/mobile/purchase-order)
├─ MobilePurchaseReceipt (/mobile/purchase-receipt)
├─ MobileQuotation (/mobile/quotation)
├─ MobileReturn (/mobile/return)
├─ MobileSales (/mobile/sales)
├─ MobileSalesDetail (/mobile/sales-detail)
├─ MobileSalesOrder (/mobile/sales-order)
└─ MobileTaxInvoice (/mobile/tax-invoice)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">2.11 백오피스·대리점 (사이드바 제거, 코드 보존)</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>Platform (본사 백오피스, 12건)
├─ AdminDashboard / AdminTenants / AdminResellers
├─ AdminCommission / AdminSettlement / AdminWatchdogMonitor
└─ PlatformDashboard / PlatformTenants / PlatformResellers
   PlatformCommission / PlatformPromotions / PlatformRevenue

Reseller (대리점 포털, 7건)
└─ ResellerDashboard / Customers / Tenants / Commission /
   Payout / Revenue / Settlement</pre></p><p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #ccc;"></p><p><h2 style="border-bottom:1px solid #999;padding-bottom:3px;color:#1976D2;">3. 사이드바 카테고리 매핑</h2></p><p><table style='border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;'><thead><tr><th style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;background:#e3f2fd;'>사이드바</th><th style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;background:#e3f2fd;'>라우트 패턴</th><th style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;background:#e3f2fd;'>화면 수</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>🏠 홈</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/dashboard</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/welcome</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>3</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>📋 마스터</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/partners/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/items/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/bom/*</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>8</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>🛒 매입</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/purchase*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/returns/*</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>9</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>💰 판매</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/quotations/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/sales*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/deliveries</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>12</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>📦 재고</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/stock/*</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>7</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>💼 재무</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/accounting/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/collections</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/payments</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>14</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>👥 인사</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/hr/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/employees</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>15</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>📝 결재</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/approval/*</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>3</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>⚙ 설정</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/settings/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/users/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/data/*</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/company</code> <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/terms</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>16</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>📱 모바일</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'><code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>/mobile/*</code></td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>10</td></tr></tbody></table>
<strong>ERP 사용자 노출 화면: 87개</strong>
<strong>백오피스·대리점 (코드 보존): 19개</strong></p><p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #ccc;"></p><p><h2 style="border-bottom:1px solid #999;padding-bottom:3px;color:#1976D2;">4. 워크플로우 3흐름 (헌법 #20)</h2></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">흐름 1. 매입</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>발주서 작성
  ↓ confirmed
매입명세서 발행 (입고)
  ↓ confirmed
stock_ledger INSERT (재고 증가)
  ↓
원장 (journal_lines INSERT)</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">흐름 2. BOM</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>BOM 헤더 + bom_items (자재 N건)
  ↓
생산 명령 (confirmed)
  ↓ 동일 트랜잭션
완제품 stock_ledger +N
자재 stock_ledger -N</pre></p><p><h3 style="color:#333;">흐름 3. 판매</h3>
<pre style='background:#f4f4f4;padding:8px;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #ddd;'>견적서 → 수주서 → 거래명세서
                    ↓ confirmed
                    stock_ledger -N (재고 차감)
                    ↓
                    세금계산서 (메이크빌 ASP / 홈택스 외주)
                    ↓
                    매출 원장 + 경리 + 세무</pre></p><p><strong>한 단계라도 끊기면 = 무결성 깨진 것 = 즉시 P0 핫픽스.</strong></p><p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #ccc;"></p><p><h2 style="border-bottom:1px solid #999;padding-bottom:3px;color:#1976D2;">5. 통계</h2></p><p><table style='border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;'><thead><tr><th style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;background:#e3f2fd;'>항목</th><th style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;background:#e3f2fd;'>수량</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>총 라우트 (Razor <code style='background:#eee;font-family:Consolas;font-size:9pt;padding:1px 4px;'>@page</code>)</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>117개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>ERP 사용자 노출 화면</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>87개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>백오피스·대리점·로그인 등 비ERP</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>30개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>API Controller</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>56개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>Application Service</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>55개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>DB 테이블</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>137개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>DB 마이그레이션 SQL</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>76개</td></tr>
<tr><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>xUnit 테스트</td><td style='border:1px solid #aaa;padding:4px 8px;'>165건</td></tr></tbody></table></p></body>
</html>